name magicnum
category Package
revision 52983
shortdesc Access TeX systems' "magic numbers"
longdesc This package allows access to the various parameter values in
longdesc TeX (catcode values), e-TeX (group, if and node types, and
longdesc interaction mode), and LuaTeX (pdfliteral mode) by a
longdesc hierarchical name system.
